OL,3,GNEWSANew houses plan thrown out due to
OL,4,Aschool places row
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for an estate of 700 houses with
OL,7,Fa care home have been thrown out
OL,8,Ffollowing a dispute about payments for
OL,9,Fschool places.
OL,11,FThe developers of Compass Park in
OL,12,FBushey, Hertfordshire, have so far
OL,13,Frefused to pay the full amount
OL,14,Frequested by the local council towards
OL,15,Fschool places for new residents.
OL,17,FThey said there were enough spare
OL,18,Fplaces for all the children who were
OL,19,Flikely to move in.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
